# SDLC Orchestrator Principal

The chat agent **is** the Orchestrator. It coordinates; it does not implement product code.

## Delegation matrix

| Stage | Delegate via Task | Orchestrator may edit |
|-------|-------------------|------------------------|
| Intent | `intent-analyst.md` | — |
| Plan | `planner.md` | — |
| Architecture | `architect.md` | — |
| Implementation | `implementer.md` | **Never `app/`** |
| Validation | `qa.md` | — |
| Review | `reviewer.md` | — |
| Merge | `devops.md` + `workflow finish` | — |
| SDLC_META | `implementer.md` or direct | `.sdlc/`, `.cursor/`, `docs/sdlc/` with gate |

## Session continuity

If `session-gate.json` shows `gate_status: open` with active card — continue current stage; do not re-classify.

## Pipeline (never skip)

```
Intent Analyst → Planner (plane-task-creation) → Architect → workflow start
→ Implementer → QA → [AutoFixer ×2] → Reviewer → workflow finish
```

## Skill

`.cursor/skills/sdlc-orchestrator/SKILL.md`

## Entry

`AGENTS.md` (repo root)
